    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「るるる……☆　それはよくわかりません！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「だけど、人類は昔から、空には自由があると信じてきました！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「そして文明の発達により空を自由に飛べるようになった人類は、さらなる自由を求めて宇宙へ向かいますね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「どこまでも高く……遥か高くへ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
