    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「あいかのひとは、幸せものですね？　幸せものです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-kimono",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-kimono_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「ど、どうしたんですか、急に……たしかに、わたしは毎日、楽しいですけど！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「今まで自由を求めて空や宇宙へ向かおうとしたひとたちの多くが、地に落ちて命を落としました」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「イカロスも、太陽に近づいて燃え尽きてしまった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「今では日常となってしまいましたが、人類は翼を得るために、多くの犠牲を出してきたんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「遠くの空に居場所を見出した、孤独なひとたちを」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「あいかのひと、あなたは今、ここが幸せだと思えている。さらに高くへ行かなくても、ここに居場所がある」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「それはとても、幸せなことだと思いますね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-kimono",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-kimono_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「え、あ……そうかもしれません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/black-ruri",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「ほとりのひとはきっと、るりの姿を見ると蛇蝎のごとく嫌います。相容れない存在として扱います」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「だから、あいかのひとのことが、正直うらやましいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-kimono",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-kimono_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あ、天宮先輩……大丈夫ですか？　なんだか、目がうつろになってますけど！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るり",
    "text": "「大丈夫です☆　ちょっと、『ふつう』の喋りかたをすると疲れちゃって……まだまだですね？」"
